sparky-stereo-browser (@DEBVERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hardware video decoding on an NVIDIA GPU shows the picture: a decoded video
    the compositor cannot import was drawn by WebRender from empty textures and
    came out solid green. Vulkan Video decoding (Mozilla's own path) is on by
    default and proved on the NVIDIA proprietary driver series 615, with the
    decoder's sandbox on; every other GPU keeps the route it had, and an NVIDIA
    driver older than 615 keeps software decoding, with the reason in
    about:support.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  @DATE@
